include AGENTS.md CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md START_HERE.md LICENSE
recursive-include docs *.md *.json *.txt *.toml *.yml *.py *.html
recursive-include tools *.py *.sh *.json *.toml *.md *.txt
